{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016020/extras/e386a80aa97f47a9f5196bfc940bc31d.apng?t=1761314239\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016020/extras/e386a80aa97f47a9f5196bfc940bc31d.poster.avif?t=1761314239\" class=\"bb_img\" width=873 height=78 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A new short horror adventure from the world of <i><strong>The Bunny Graveyard</strong></i>, for new and returning players alike!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHAT'S IN THIS DEMO?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the DEMO, you can <strong>experience the first night</strong> in the gas station and get a taste of the story! Unlock skins, find secrets, and replay the game in HARD MODE!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016020/extras/142615bcbd9d8cba44d4eb5ac7b9477a.poster.avif?t=1761314239\" width=800 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016020/extras/142615bcbd9d8cba44d4eb5ac7b9477a.webm?t=1761314239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016020/extras/142615bcbd9d8cba44d4eb5ac7b9477a.mp4?t=1761314239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By day, you run a small gas station in <strong>Carrot Town</strong>, serving its quirky citizens, meeting their strange demands, and keeping your promise. By night, the power goes out, and a terrifying monster lurks in the shadows. Check the vents, peek through the windows, and stay on guard... all while sneaking in a round of <i><strong>Chunky JUMP!</strong></i> on your trusty <strong>BIRD BOY</strong> console.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STORY MODE</strong>: Find out more about Carrot Town's mysteries and meet new friends as you survive each terrifying night in the gas station. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ENDLESS MODE</strong>: A rouge-like mode where you'll play multiple random levels with randomized enemies and events. Anything can happen in this mode! (No, really, anything can happen.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COLLECT</strong> skins for Chunky and meet some new and familiar faces...</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CUSTOMIZE</strong> your BIRD BOY with different colors!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock\u00a0<strong>HARD MODE</strong>, monsters are more difficult, resources are limted, game crashes are more common, and more!</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The First Night","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4016020/1e5819948f045f198d47d17df898ed1fd1b19a3f.jpg"},{"name":"A Challenging First Night","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4016020/566f6243a8a6273442060e9b2ed43b5f59c93e4d.jpg"},{"name":"Who's on the TV?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4016020/8f0dd30931ff2288d766b43ad8fbc0fdeaec0589.jpg"},{"name":"Fashionably Chunky","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4016020/b7ae466a79a23cc08cd233f75c533beabb1a54cb.jpg"},{"name":"I NEED THAT BUBBLE GUM!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4016020/eb54aeeb4121af75135d867382c4915fea734050.jpg"},{"name":"Cookie Master: Night 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4016020/2f841481ed31ebd039b670e628dab48d40ea83cb.jpg"},{"name":"Cookie Master: Night 1+","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4016020/662e9a2f97d138d77e5852a170588e771f4909c5.jpg"},{"name":"Cookie Master: Intro","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4016020/61334e11c69c89c2ba60eb29b96a01da12300145.jpg"},{"name":"Cookie Master: Intro+","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4016020/649995e28244048627bebb04f6adb4e2dd8e281d.jpg"}],"total":9},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4016020?t=1761314239","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4016020?t=1761314239","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016020/2569fec03bbe40417663a7fabe09de7e9e9ad9ae/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761314239","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016020/2569fec03bbe40417663a7fabe09de7e9e9ad9ae/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761314239","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016020/extras/e386a80aa97f47a9f5196bfc940bc31d.apng?t=1761314239\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016020/extras/e386a80aa97f47a9f5196bfc940bc31d.poster.avif?t=1761314239\" class=\"bb_img\" width=873 height=78 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A new short horror adventure from the world of <i><strong>The Bunny Graveyard</strong></i>, for new and returning players alike!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHAT'S IN THIS DEMO?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the DEMO, you can <strong>experience the first night</strong> in the gas station and get a taste of the story! Unlock skins, find secrets, and replay the game in HARD MODE!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016020/extras/142615bcbd9d8cba44d4eb5ac7b9477a.poster.avif?t=1761314239\" width=800 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016020/extras/142615bcbd9d8cba44d4eb5ac7b9477a.webm?t=1761314239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016020/extras/142615bcbd9d8cba44d4eb5ac7b9477a.mp4?t=1761314239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By day, you run a small gas station in <strong>Carrot Town</strong>, serving its quirky citizens, meeting their strange demands, and keeping your promise. By night, the power goes out, and a terrifying monster lurks in the shadows. Check the vents, peek through the windows, and stay on guard... all while sneaking in a round of <i><strong>Chunky JUMP!</strong></i> on your trusty <strong>BIRD BOY</strong> console.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STORY MODE</strong>: Find out more about Carrot Town's mysteries and meet new friends as you survive each terrifying night in the gas station. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ENDLESS MODE</strong>: A rouge-like mode where you'll play multiple random levels with randomized enemies and events. Anything can happen in this mode! (No, really, anything can happen.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COLLECT</strong> skins for Chunky and meet some new and familiar faces...</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CUSTOMIZE</strong> your BIRD BOY with different colors!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock\u00a0<strong>HARD MODE</strong>, monsters are more difficult, resources are limted, game crashes are more common, and more!</p></li></ul>","developers":["Pichon Games"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3606780","name":"Chunky JUMP!"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016020/afd8de28f6679282f2d6434de9e52b6832398bfb/header.jpg?t=1761314239","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Pichon Games. All rights reserved. All other trademarks are the properties of their respective owners.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4016020/1338531232/a30dedff7bae075142e7aefe61ab4d0ec157a4f2/1761007338/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761007763","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4016020/1338531232/a30dedff7bae075142e7aefe61ab4d0ec157a4f2/1761007338/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761007763","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4016020/1338531232/a30dedff7bae075142e7aefe61ab4d0ec157a4f2/1761007338/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761007763","id":257200456,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257200456/movie480.mp4?t=1761007763","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257200456/movie_max.mp4?t=1761007763"},"name":"Chunky JUMP! Demo Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257200456/e44f49ea7f35b1276888d0f1825d3a0332b18a2b/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1761007763","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257200456/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1761007763","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257200456/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1761007763"}}],"name":"C